category: Utils
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Recover lost JPEGs and MOV files on a bogus memory card or disk"
ldesc: "recoverjpeg tries to recover JFIF (JPEG) pictures and MOV movies (using
recovermov) from a peripheral. This may be useful if you mistakenly overwrite
a partition or if a device such as a digital camera memory card is bogus. You
can also read the recoverjpeg story."
skip:

homepage: https://rfc1149.net/devel/recoverjpeg.html
